  and GPL3.txt are distributed under /opt in the image.
* SABnzbd Python dependencies, including sabctools, are pinned with source and
  wheel hashes in uv.lock. Installed distribution metadata and license notices
  are retained under /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages.
* UnRAR 7.3.2 is compiled from RARLAB's unmodified official source:
  https://www.rarlab.com/rar/unrarsrc-7.3.2.tar.gz
  Its full redistribution license is retained at
  /usr/share/licenses/downloads/unrar.txt, including the restriction against
  using its code to develop a RAR-compatible archiver.
* par2cmdline and 7-Zip are installed from Alpine repositories. Their
  respective licenses apply. Inspect installed package metadata with
  `apk info --all` and obtain corresponding package sources from
  https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports/-/tree/3.22-stable.

